# Overview

HEM提供设备管理应用激活DPC（Device Policy Controller，设备策略管理器）App许可证的功能类。

## Interface Summary

|Interface|Description|
|:-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:-------------------------------|
|[HemLicenseStatusListener](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/system-References/hemlicensestatuslistener-0000001058503928)|HEM提供给DPC App的MDM License状态回调接口。|

## Class Summary

|Class|Description|
|:---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:-----------------------------------|
|[HemLicenseManager](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/system-References/hemlicensemanager-0000001058803272)|DPC App的MDM License管理器，负责设置与取消权限等操作。|

